","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_R4DV4x"]},"accordion_row_NzTjf6":{"type":"_accordion-row","settings":{"heading":"Hvordan foregår aldersverificeringen?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_6tqqRk":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Vi benytter MitID til at verificere din alder, når du handler hos os. Du vil blive bedt om at logge ind med MitID i forbindelse med din bestilling. Processen er hurtig, sikker og i overensstemmelse med gældende lovkrav. Vi gemmer ikke dine MitID-loginoplysninger. Dine data behandles i overensstemmelse med GDPR og vores privatlivspolitik<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"0.875rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_6tqqRk"]},"accordion_row_9VbYzJ":{"type":"_accordion-row","settings":{"heading":"Kan jeg ændre eller annullere min ordre?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_NiwNFa":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Hvis du ønsker at ændre eller annullere din ordre, skal du kontakte os hurtigst muligt via e-mail eller telefon, kontakt os <a href=\"\/pages\/kontakt\" title=\"Kontakt\">her.<\/a> Når ordren er afsendt, kan vi desværre ikke længere ændre den.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"0.875rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","backgroun